Operational lessons
- ALO len=0 is not a no-op wrapper semantically; it still participates in lexical readback/lifting pathways.
- Any “direct static term at dep=0” optimization must be gated by a stronger invariant than empty lexical env.
- Keep `--as-c` telemetry serialized; parallel runs can still be noisy/non-deterministic in artifact handling.

